  "aliases": [
    "1 Thess",
    "1Thess",
    "1 Th",
    "1Th"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "But of the times and the seasons, brethren, ye have no need that I write unto you.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "For yourselves know perfectly that the day of the Lord so cometh as a thief in the night.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "For when they shall say, Peace and safety; then sudden destruction cometh upon them, as travail upon a woman with child; and they shall not escape.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "But ye, brethren, are not in darkness, that that day should overtake you as a thief.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "Ye are all the children of light, and the children of the day: we are not of the night, nor of darkness.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "Therefore let us not sleep, as do others; but let us watch and be sober.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "For they that sleep sleep in the night; and they that be drunken are drunken in the night.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "But let us, who are of the day, be sober, putting on the breastplate of faith and love; and for an helmet, the hope of salvation.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "For God hath not appointed us to wrath, but to obtain salvation by our Lord Jesus Christ,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "Who died for us, that, whether we wake or sleep, we should live together with him.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "Wherefore comfort yourselves together, and edify one another, even as also ye do.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "And we beseech you, brethren, to know them which labour among you, and are over you in the Lord, and admonish you;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "And to esteem them very highly in love for their work’s sake. And be at peace among yourselves.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "Now we exhort you, brethren, warn them that are unruly, comfort the feebleminded, support the weak, be patient toward all men.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "See that none render evil for evil unto any man; but ever follow that which is good, both among yourselves, and to all men.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "Rejoice evermore.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "Pray without ceasing.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "In every thing give thanks: for this is the will of God in Christ Jesus concerning you.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "Quench not the Spirit.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "Despise not prophesyings.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "Prove all things; hold fast that which is good.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-022",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 22,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:22",
      "numberLabel": "22",
      "text": "Abstain from all appearance of evil.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:22",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-023",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 23,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:23",
      "numberLabel": "23",
      "text": "And the very God of peace sanctify you wholly; and I pray God your whole spirit and soul and body be preserved blameless unto the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:23",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:23"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-024",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 24,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:24",
      "numberLabel": "24",
      "text": "Faithful is he that calleth you, who also will do it.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:24",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:24"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-025",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 25,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:25",
      "numberLabel": "25",
      "text": "Brethren, pray for us.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:25",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:25"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-026",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 26,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:26",
      "numberLabel": "26",
      "text": "Greet all the brethren with an holy kiss.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:26",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:26"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-027",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 27,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:27",
      "numberLabel": "27",
      "text": "I charge you by the Lord that this epistle be read unto all the holy brethren.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:27",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:27"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-028",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 28,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:28",
      "numberLabel": "28",
      "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you. Amen.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 5:28",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:5:28"
      }
    }
  ],
